WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.161
Hi there! Who are you?

2
00:00:11.162 --> 00:00:14.512
I'm a cheetah.

3
00:00:14.513 --> 00:00:17.872
Cheetahs are a type of large cat.

4
00:00:17.873 --> 00:00:22.861
We're the fastest land animal on earth!

5
00:00:22.862 --> 00:00:25.902
Where do you live?

6
00:00:25.903 --> 00:00:28.782
We live in Africa.

7
00:00:28.783 --> 00:00:36.921
We live in open grasslands called savannas.

8
00:00:36.922 --> 00:00:41.021
You have lots of cool spots.

9
00:00:41.022 --> 00:00:44.816
Cheetahs are covered with black dots.

10
00:00:44.817 --> 00:00:51.322
They help us hide in the grass.

11
00:00:51.323 --> 00:00:54.352
What do you eat?

12
00:00:54.353 --> 00:01:00.012
Cheetahs mostly eat small animals like hares.

13
00:01:00.013 --> 00:01:05.479
But we also eat big animals like antelopes!

14
00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:09.683
How do cheetahs run so fast?

15
00:01:09.684 --> 00:01:13.936
Our legs are very powerful.

16
00:01:13.937 --> 00:01:20.011
We're also thin, with small heads.

17
00:01:20.012 --> 00:01:24.975
Cheetahs probably always catch their prey.

18
00:01:24.976 --> 00:01:26.748
Nope!

19
00:01:26.749 --> 00:01:30.581
Cheetahs can only run for about a minute.

20
00:01:30.582 --> 00:01:42.642
Then we need to rest.

21
00:01:42.643 --> 00:01:45.742
How do you hunt then?

22
00:01:45.743 --> 00:01:50.362
Cheetahs can see very far.

23
00:01:50.363 --> 00:01:56.182
We spot our prey and sneak closer . . .

24
00:01:56.183 --> 00:02:02.570
Once we're close enough, we run—fast!

25
00:02:02.571 --> 00:02:05.909
I see an antelope.

26
00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:09.810
Good-bye!

27
00:02:09.811 --> 00:02:17.163
Good-bye, Cheetah!

